      "content": "Those archetypes are a great start. To make it feel more realistic and \"street-level,\" I want to give them some specific identities. Can you provide some more detailed profiles for them? I'm thinking about their backgrounds, names, and maybe what ethnic or cultural groups they might belong to to make them feel like they actually belong to the specific neighborhoods where the crime is happening. Just try to make them feel grounded and authentic to a rough urban setting.",
